{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 8, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "Upon the morrow’s dawn shallst thou embark upon thy grand voyage to the fair Land of the Rising Sun where the cherry blossoms do dance and the ancient temples whisper secrets of old. Forsooth let this itinerary be thy guide through the realms of wonder and delight.\n\n**Day the First:** Arrive in Tokyo the bustling metropolis where the neon lights do gleam like stars fallen to earth. Wander through Shibuya’s throngs and gaze upon the famed crossing where multitudes move as one. In the eve visit the Imperial Palace and marvel at the gardens where shoguns of yore did stroll.\n\n**Day the Second:** Venture to Asakusa and pay homage at the Senso-ji temple where the great red lantern doth hang. Don thy yukata and partake in a tea ceremony where the matcha’s bitter grace doth cleanse the soul. In the dusk take a river cruise upon the Sumida and watch the city lights reflect upon the water’s face.\n\n**Day the Third:** Journey to Nikko the sacred retreat where nature and divinity intertwine. Gaze upon the Toshogu Shrine where the golden carvings do gleam with splendor. Wander the cedar-lined paths and breathe the air of the gods.\n\n**Day the Fourth:** Return to Tokyo and hie thee to Ueno Park where the peacocks do strut and the ponds do teem with koi. Visit the Tokyo National Museum and behold the treasures of the past. In the night attend a sumo wrestling match where the titans of flesh do clash in ritual might.\n\n**Day the Fifth:** Take the shinkansen to Kyoto the ancient capital where tradition doth reign supreme. Visit the Kinkaku-ji the Golden Pavilion where the temple’s surface doth gleam like a sunlit lake. Wander the Philosopher’s Path and lose thyself in thought as the cherry blossoms fall like snow.\n\n**Day the Sixth:** Proceed to the Fushimi Inari Shrine where the thousand torii gates do form a crimson path to the mount. Climb to the summit and be rewarded with vistas that steal the breath. In the eve partake in a kaiseki feast where each dish is a poem upon the tongue.\n\n**Day the Seventh:** Return to Tokyo and spend the day in the verdant oasis of the Meiji Shrine. Walk the forest paths and hearken to the silence that doth enfold thee. In the dusk visit the teamLab Planets where digital art doth weave its magic and the body becomes a canvas.\n\n**Day the Eighth:** Farewell Japan with a final pilgrimage to the Tsukiji Outer Market where the freshest of fish do gleam upon the ice. Savor the tuna’s rich flesh and the uni’s oceanic sweetness. With a heart full of memories take thy leave of this land where the past and present do waltz in eternal harmony.\n\nThus endeth thy journey through the Land of the Rising Sun. May thy memories be as vivid as the cherry blossoms and thy soul be as enriched as the temples of old. Safe travels noble traveler.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -2.3901968002319336}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.28558358550071716}, {"token": " mor", "logprob": -0.885195255279541}, {"token": "row", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.3614741265773773}, {"token": " dawn", "logprob": -0.3495250642299652}, {"token": " shall", "logprob": -1.585937261581421}, {"token": "st", "logprob": -0.5626185536384583}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.007969486527144909}, {"token": " embark", "logprob": -0.4921981692314148}, {"token": " upon", "logprob": -0.02313048392534256}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -0.20298981666564941}, {"token": " grand", "logprob": -0.5581363439559937}, {"token": " voyage", "logprob": -0.29656508564949036}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.005469002760946751}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.13653527200222015}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.46512654423713684}, {"token": " Land", "logprob": -3.131917715072632}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -2.884823152271565e-05}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.01593368873000145}, {"token": " Ris